{
  "version": 4,
  "why": "Compose P3 (N1, N3, F4): workers send within per-provider token buckets, failed sends wait in a delay queue with exponential backoff (then a DLQ), and every outcome is checked against and recorded in the log, so redeliveries never send twice.",
  "nodes": [
